      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "共享内存的 32 个 Bank",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "共享内存的 32 个 Bank",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dLNqzUfljZoJXyuM-TCh4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": -180,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 227198894,
      "version": 137,
      "versionNonce": 1648388466,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792229760966,
      "created": 1792229549940,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GPU 的共享内存被分成 32 个 Bank（Bank 0 ~ Bank 31）。每个 Bank 每周期只能服务一个地址。\n如果一个 warp（32 个线程）里，多个线程同时访问同一个 Bank，它们就必须\"串行排队\"，这就是 Bank 冲突。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GPU 的共享内存被分成 32 个 Bank（Bank 0 ~ Bank 31）。每个 Bank 每周期只能服务一个地址。\n如果一个 warp（32 个线程）里，多个线程同时访问同一个 Bank，它们就必须\"串行排队\"，这就是 Bank 冲突。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
