      "created": 1792229549942,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bank 冲突的本质是 \"多个线程抢同一个窗口\"，解决办法是让线程访问错开的 Bank",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bank 冲突的本质是 \"多个线程抢同一个窗口\"，解决办法是让线程访问错开的 Bank",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
